Use prefix ex with namespace "https://example.org/breach-notification#".
Use prefix gdpr with namespace "https://w3id.org/dpv/legal/eu/gdpr#".

ex:lostLaptop has ex:exemptFrom gdpr:DataSubjectBreachNotice.
ex:misdirectedEmail has ex:outcome ex:documentOnly.
ex:databaseLeak has ex:brokenDuty ex:alertShop.
ex:lostLaptop has ex:requires gdpr:DPABreachNotice.
ex:databaseLeak has ex:requires gdpr:DPABreachNotice.
ex:ransomware has ex:requires gdpr:DPABreachNotice.
ex:databaseLeak has ex:requires gdpr:DataSubjectBreachNotice.
ex:lostLaptop has ex:authorityNotice ex:onTime.
ex:ransomware has ex:authorityNotice ex:onTime.
ex:databaseLeak has ex:authorityNotice ex:lateWithReasons.
ex:register has ex:peopleToInform 1200.
